hinery.QuantumTorus.scaleAlgHom_T","kind":"theorem","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/QuantumTorusQDifference.lean#L87-L90","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.QuantumTorus.scaleAlgHom","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.QuantumTorus.scaleAlgHom","kind":"def","line":83,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/QuantumTorusQDifference.lean#L83-L85","doc":"The scaling `M ↦ u·M` of `R[M^±]`, as an `R`-algebra map. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.QuantumTorus.scaleUnit_zpow","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.QuantumTorus.scaleUnit_zpow","kind":"theorem","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/QuantumTorusQDifference.lean#L69-L81","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.QuantumTorus.scaleUnit","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.QuantumTorus.scaleUnit","kind":"def","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/QuantumTorusQDifference.lean#L60-L67","doc":"The unit `u·M` of `R[M^±]`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.QuantumTorus.twistedComm_emb_eq_zero_iff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.QuantumTorus.twistedComm_emb_eq_zero_iff","kind":"theorem","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/QuantumTorusQDifference.lean#L38-L52","doc":"**Kernel of the twisted commutator.** `a` commutes with `L` iff `σ a = a`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.QuantumTorus.twistedComm_emb","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.QuantumTorus.twistedComm_emb","kind":"theorem","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/QuantumTorusQDifference.lean#L33-L36","doc":"**The q-difference operator is inner (twisted).** `(L·a - a·L)·L⁻¹ = σ a - a`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.QuantumTorus.emb_injective","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.QuantumTorus.emb_injective","kind":"theorem","line":27,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/QuantumTorusQDifference.lean#L27-L31","signatureChunk":0}]}